  update products set summary = 'Introducing The Nozzle– a cutting-edge purging device strategically positioned at the termination of the tailpipe assembly beneath the Vortex Desander. This innovative system incorporates an internal design featuring multiple upward obstacles, inducing a significant pressure drop that mitigates the impact of bottom hole pressure in the upper chamber of the valve.

Conversely, the sand present in the tail joints undergoes precipitation and is efficiently expelled beyond the valve into the wellbore. This expulsion is facilitated by the combined forces of gravity and hydrostatic pressure within the tail joints. These fundamental principles actively operate within the tool, effectively preventing the bypassing of the Vortex Desander.

